# README screenshots live in docs/ so they are not shipped to the CDN
# (everything under public/ is deployed with the app).
public/screenshots/

# App assets under public/ MUST stay tracked: Vercel builds from the repo, so
# an ignored asset is simply absent in production. /og-image.png is referenced
# by the OpenGraph/Twitter metadata on every page and as the blog image
# fallback — it was silently 404ing in production because of the *.png rule.
!public/**/*.png
